# forge/fit/bosses: bosses (FOUNDRY, Fjordfolk, Imperial, Jade; 28.3): round bosses centred on the piece's panel, each a
# lit cap with a glint and a dark rim (two on a wide panel, one on a narrow one).
# FORGE-MARKS, forge i2 (tools: emb_P2c/forge/areas/FORGE-MARKS/tools2/mk2.py). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# FITTING (`overlay fit.<v>`): P-box fits (`tags tile overlay fit`, `on-region P`: the largest <w>x<h> view that fits
# the piece's panel, centred: bosses, star rivets, knotwork), seam fittings (`on-region N`, a periodic tile on the seams
# the cut marks: rivets), or plane tiles (`on-slot:<slot>`, as a cut: studs, scored lines, the inlay band, lacing).
# Cells as the limb tile's (region tiles) or the cut tile's (plane tiles).
use person
role overlay fit.bosses
tags tile overlay fit
on-region P
legend + ink 3
legend ^ ink 4
legend : ink 1
legend = ink 0
legend O metal2 2

view D key bosses2x2 origin 0 0
|+:
|:=

view D key bosses3x3 origin 0 0
|.+.
|++:
|.=.

view D key bosses6x3 origin 0 0
|.+..+.
|++::+:
|.=..=.

view D key bosses7x3 origin 0 0
|.+...+.
|++:.++:
|.=...=.

view D key bosses4x4 origin 0 0
|.++.
|+++:
|++::
|.==.

view D key bosses5x5 origin 0 0
|..+..
|.+++.
|+++::
|.+::.
|..=..

view D key bosses1x1 origin 0 0
|+

view D key bosses2x1 origin 0 0
|+:

view D key bosses1x2 origin 0 0
|+
|=

view D key bosses3x1 origin 0 0
|++:

view D key bosses5x1 origin 0 0
|+:.+:

view D key bosses1x3 origin 0 0
|+
|+
|=
